# Findings log — append-only, observations only.
#
# One JSON object per line, one line per flagged co-activation event.
# NO conclusions field. This is a lab notebook, not a results table.
#
# Required keys:
#   ts          — UTC ISO8601 timestamp of the run
#   issue       — GitHub issue number that produced this record
#   run_id      — agent run-id (see docs/MULTI_AGENT_WORKFLOW.md)
#   model       — exact model id, e.g. "pythia-160m"
#   revision    — HF revision/commit if pinned, else null
#   dtype       — e.g. "float32"
#   sae         — SAE id, e.g. "res-jb" or null if raw activations
#   layer       — layer index or hook name
#   feature_id  — SAE feature index, or null
#   hook        — TransformerLens hook name if applicable
#   inputs_a    — the first input set / prompts (list)
#   inputs_b    — the second input set / prompts (list)
#   activation_a, activation_b — observed activation values
#   null_model  — how the baseline was constructed (REQUIRED)
#   correction  — multiplicity correction applied (REQUIRED)
#   n           — number of comparisons in the family (REQUIRED)
#   statistic   — observed value of the test statistic
#   p_corrected — corrected p-value, or null
#   confounds_checked — which confounds were tested (list)
#   confounds_fired   — which of those fired (list)
#   verdict     — "flagged" | "null"  (a label, NOT a conclusion)
#
# A record with no null_model / correction / n is not evidence.
